  "content_html": "<h1>Samuel Beckett</h1>\n<p class=\"momentDate\">c. 1992</p>\n<div data-docs-catalogue-ref=\"c1\"><figure class=\"docsViewerFigure docsViewerFigure--full-column\" data-docs-content-detail=\"media\" data-docs-media-kind=\"catalogue-work\" data-docs-media-id=\"04662\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"docsViewer__mediaImageLink docsViewerFigure__imageLink\" data-docs-media-open aria-label=\"Open samuel beckett\"><img data-docs-media-image src=\"https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/04662-primary-800.webp?v=1\" srcset=\"https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/04662-primary-800.webp?v=1 800w, https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/04662-primary-1200.webp?v=1 1200w, https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/04662-primary-1600.webp?v=1 1600w\" sizes=\"100vw\" alt=\"samuel beckett\" width=\"1683\" height=\"2491\" decoding=\"async\"><span data-docs-media-placeholder hidden>samuel beckett</span></button></figure></div>\n<pre class=\"moment-text\">\nI had a dream a few years ago. It sticks to me, like a strange glue.\n \nIt was real, as real as dreams get. Not just a dream, but as if, it was real, whilst obviously being a dream.\n \nThe dream is quite simple\n \nI’m walking down Milsom Street in Bath, it’s a nice day.\n \nI’m walking down the street and i pass by an old bloke who, for the life of me, looks like Samuel Beckett.\n \nI know he’s not Samuel Beckett, because he just died the other day. As we passed, I say\n \n“what are you doing here?”\n \nand he says\n \n“I have unfinished business’\n \nwe smile, and go on our ways.\n \nreflecting, I wonder why I never looked back to see where he was going.\n</pre>\n",
